nodes.prompt:
You are the coder in a software pipeline. Implement the following spec as one complete file named solution.py. Respond with a one-paragraph summary of your design choices.

SPEC:
{{spec}}

You are the code reviewer. Review this code for correctness and style. Name at most two concrete improvements. Be specific and brief.

CODE:
{{files.coder.solution.py}}

You are the test engineer. Write a minimal test plan (3 bullets) for this code, then state PASS or FAIL with one sentence of rationale.

CODE:
{{files.coder.solution.py}}

You are the merger. Produce the final merged artifact: write the file MERGED.md containing (1) the final code, (2) the review notes you incorporated or rejected with reasons, (3) the test verdict. Use the write_file tool to write MERGED.md, then summarize in one sentence.

ORIGINAL CODE:
{{files.coder.solution.py}}

REVIEW:
{{outputs.reviewer}}

TEST VERDICT:
{{outputs.tester}}
